OL,3,GNEWSA'Friend who gave me his kidney
OL,4,Achanged my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man says his life has been
OL,7,Ftransformed after receiving a kidney
OL,8,Ffrom one of his oldest friends.
OL,10,FCarl Dunderdale, of Brigg, was
OL,11,Fdiagnosed with Berger's disease, which
OL,12,Fcaused his kidney function to decline.
OL,13,FHis friend, Andrew Hensby, donated one
OL,14,Fof his kidneys.
OL,16,FIn August, Dunderdale won gold at the
OL,17,FUK Transplant Games in Sheffield and
OL,18,Fqualified to represent Great Britain at
OL,19,Fthe World Transplant Games in Belgium
OL,20,Fnext year.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
